  "warnings": [
   "THE META SCHEDULE CONVERSION IS STILL BROKEN, ELEVEN DAYS ON. W38 schedules: Aqua 10 (6 in W37, 19 in W36), Hutong 1 (4, 11), The Chinese Library 2 (null, 10), Cantina 2 (1, 7), Dim Sum Library 2 (1, 4), Shiro shared 7 (null, 20), Vesu 2 (null, 9). The Canton Library went 13 to 19 and is the only account behaving normally. Meta bookings and Meta CPA for W38 are not performance figures. Hutong recorded one Schedule against HK$4,722 of spend and 260 SevenRooms website bookings.",
