   "SETTLING RE-CHECKED, NOTHING CARRIED FORWARD. Prior and year-ago weeks were re-pulled this run. Google W37 booking conversions settled upward at every account since last week: Aqua 47.99 to 49.03, Hutong 17 to 20.29, TCL 21 to 22, Shiro 37 to 39.48, Vesu 34 to 37, DSL 47.98 (first pull on this basis). Walk-in signals also settled up: Aqua W37 494 to 844, Hutong 2166 to 2150, Cantina 997 to 1132, Shiro 130 to 205.",
