   "Dim Sum Library Google has no walk-in conversion actions at all (only the booking action exists). Published as null, not zero. Vesu Google likewise has no walk-in actions.",
   "Vesu Meta bookings and CPA use the conversion (leads) campaign only. W38 conversion-campaign spend HK$2,493.52 with 2 schedules; the awareness campaign HK$721.53 carries no cost per booking. W37 returned no Schedule rows at all, published as null.",
   "FLAGGED FOR REVIEW, FOURTH WEEK: The Canton Library Google (5594089398). Spend more than doubled to HK$13,328.05 from HK$5,974.30, almost all of it in one campaign, Search > Open Now, which went from HK$1,952.39 to HK$8,140.12. The booking action 'Canton Library HK (web) sevenrooms_booking_complete' recorded 22 against 57 create-path GA4 bookings, a book_now_button_click action recorded 139, and a Booking GTAG action 21.95. Still not a verified working import, so Canton Google bookings and CPA stay published as not available, never zero, and the account Google spend is kept out of ad-driven bookings, blended CPA and the paid funnel.",
